Parsed test spec with 2 sessions

starting permutation: s1_plans
step s1_plans: 
	EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT count(*) FROM sk WHERE c = 1;
	SET enable_bitmapscan = off;
	EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT sum(id) FROM sk WHERE c = 1;
	EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT sum(id) FROM sk WHERE k = 1;
	SET pg_lion.enable_plain_scan = off;
	SET pg_lion.pushdown_margin = 1000;
	SET enable_indexonlyscan = off;
	EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT id FROM sk WHERE c = 1 ORDER BY id LIMIT 3;
	RESET pg_lion.enable_plain_scan;
	RESET pg_lion.pushdown_margin;
	RESET enable_bitmapscan;
	RESET enable_indexonlyscan;
	SET enable_indexscan = off;
	EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT sum(id) FROM sk WHERE c = 1;
	EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT sum(id) FROM sk WHERE k = 1;
	RESET enable_indexscan;
	SET enable_hashjoin = off;
	SET enable_mergejoin = off;
	SET enable_nestloop = off;
	EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT count(*) FROM skd WHERE pk BETWEEN 1 AND 2
	  AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM sk WHERE sk.c = skd.pk);
	RESET enable_hashjoin;
	RESET enable_mergejoin;
	RESET enable_nestloop;
	EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT count(*) FROM sk WHERE c BETWEEN 1 AND 3;
	EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT count(*) FROM sk WHERE c IN (1, 3);
	EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT count(*) FROM sk WHERE k = 1;
	EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT count(*) FROM sk WHERE k BETWEEN 1 AND 3;

QUERY PLAN                  
----------------------------
Custom Scan (LionCount)     
  Lion Indexes: sk_c (c = 1)
(2 rows)

QUERY PLAN                       
---------------------------------
Aggregate                        
  ->  Index Scan using sk_c on sk
        Index Cond: (c = 1)      
(3 rows)

QUERY PLAN                       
---------------------------------
Aggregate                        
  ->  Index Scan using sk_k on sk
        Index Cond: (k = 1)      
(3 rows)

QUERY PLAN                           
-------------------------------------
Limit                                
  ->  Custom Scan (LionOrdered) on sk
        Ordered By: sk_id            
        Lion Cond: (c = 1)           
        Lion Indexes: sk_c           
(5 rows)

QUERY PLAN                           
-------------------------------------
Aggregate                            
  ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on sk         
        Recheck Cond: (c = 1)        
        ->  Bitmap Index Scan on sk_c
              Index Cond: (c = 1)    
(5 rows)

QUERY PLAN                           
-------------------------------------
Aggregate                            
  ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on sk         
        Recheck Cond: (k = 1)        
        ->  Bitmap Index Scan on sk_k
              Index Cond: (k = 1)    
(5 rows)

QUERY PLAN                                               
---------------------------------------------------------
Aggregate                                                
  ->  Custom Scan (LionSemiJoin)                         
        Lion Indexes: sk_c (c = skd.pk)                  
        Join Rows: the outer rows with a match           
        ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on skd                      
              Recheck Cond: ((pk >= 1) AND (pk <= 2))    
              ->  Bitmap Index Scan on skd_pkey          
                    Index Cond: ((pk >= 1) AND (pk <= 2))
(8 rows)

QUERY PLAN                              
----------------------------------------
Custom Scan (LionCount)                 
  Lion Indexes: sk_c (c >= 1 AND c <= 3)
(2 rows)

QUERY PLAN                                         
---------------------------------------------------
